       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "add more enemies and throwables in the final fight,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed a bug that caused NPC conversations to go out of context when trying to interact during a conversation,",
